python3-structlog (Structured Logging for Python)

Makes structured logging with key-value logging, incremental context
building, and arbitrary formatting easy.

Build-time dependencies:

python3-build python3-installer

python3-hatchling python3-hatch_vcs python3-hatch_fancy_pypi_readme

Runtime dependency:
python3-pyproject-hooks (when python3 < 3.10)
